édures via memory_run ? Détermine : (1) comment une procédure persistée est retrouvée et appariée à une nouvelle question (identité, sélection, fichier src/memory.ts et src/memory-output.ts), (2) comment elle est exécutée et rejouée (function_try, replay), et (3) quelle preuve structurée atteste que la sortie d'une procédure rejouée a été pertinente et utilisée. Produis un JSON structuré avec des références fichier:ligne réelles du workspace."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"8qczpohFE","type":"function","function":{"name":"function_try","arguments":"{\"source\":\"function searchToursMemoryPath(): { file: string; line: number; context: string }[] {\\n  // Search the entire workspace for any occurrence of the string '.tours/.memory'\\n  const matches: { file: string; line: number; context: string }[] = [];\\n  const files = listFiles();\\n  for (const file of files) {\\n    if (!file.endsWith('.ts') && !file.endsWith('.js')) continue;\\n    try {\\n      const lines = readLines(file, 1, 100000);\\n      for (let i = 0; i < lines.length; i++) {\\n        const line = lines[i];\\n        if (line.text.includes('.tours/.memory')) {\\n          matches.push({ file: file, line: line.start, context: line.text.trim() });\\n        }\\n      }\\n    } catch {\\n      // Skip files that can't be read\\n    }\\n  }\\n  return matches;\\n}\",\"params\":{},\"name\":\"search_tours_memory_path\",\"question\":\"Find all references to the path .tours/.memory in the codebase to confirm its existence and usage\",\"description\":\"Searches the entire codebase for any occurrence of the string '.tours/.memory' to identify files that reference this directory and understand its role\",\"returns\":\"Array of { file: string; line: number; context: string } where each entry is a line containing '.tours/.memory' with its file path, line number, and the line content.\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"8qczpohFE","content":"{\"error\":\"TS2339:9:Property 'length' does not exist on t