om another. Syntactic matches are candidates, not proven semantic relations; report missing evidence as uncertainty. If a stored function was selected for its declared subject but returned unusable output, call memory_unusable."},{"role":"user","content":"Dans ce workspace, comment fonctionne la validation des sorties et des citations du harness de recherche ? Détermine : (1) ce que fait src/citation-validator.ts (règles, motifs de refus, interaction avec l'historique d'outils), (2) ce que le contrat src/tool-contract.ts impose aux outils (runScript, fonction stricte, timeout) et comment l'exécution réelle est contrôlée (sandbox, exploration-sandbox), (3) quels refus d'écriture ou de consolidation peuvent survenir et comment ils sont signalés. Produis un JSON structuré avec des références fichier:ligne réelles du workspace."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"0zweEnHz7","type":"function","function":{"name":"function_try","arguments":"{\"source\":\"listFiles()\",\"params\":{},\"name\":\"list_workspace_files\",\"question\":\"List all files in the workspace to identify relevant source files for analysis\",\"description\":\"Returns the list of files in the current workspace to help identify which source files to examine for the validation harness system\",\"returns\":\"string[]\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"0zweEnHz7","content":"{\"result\":[\".npmrc\",\".tours/.memory/8bbdd70ec3d478897e7fa877e6b7a0636f9efa28734ee963a1426d6094b40887.json\",\".tours/.memory/functions/find_memory_run_references.ts\",\".tours/.memory/functions/search_tours_memory_path.ts\",\"benchmarks/query-probe.mjs\",\"dist/citation-validator.js\",\"dist/cli.js\",\"dist/decomposition-prompt.js\",\"dist/exploration-evidence.js\",\"dist/exploration-helpers.js\",\"dist/explore.js\",\"dist/memory-output.js\",\"dist/memory.js\",\"dist/mistral.js\",\"dist/primitives.js\",\"dist/research-log.js\",\"dist/tool-contract.js\",\"dist/workspace.js\",\"package-lock.json\",\"package.json\",\"README.md\