kens, outputTokens, usageAvailable, memoryReuses) to find exact logging locations\",\"files\":[\"src/*.ts\"]},{\"action\":\"Search for .tours/.memory path references to understand memory persistence structure\",\"files\":[\"src/*.ts\"]},{\"action\":\"Search for memory_run references to understand memory persistence API\",\"files\":[\"src/*.ts\"]},{\"action\":\"Read src/explore.ts to understand how research runs are executed and logged\",\"files\":[\"src/explore.ts\"]},{\"action\":\"Read src/cli.ts to understand how runs are initiated and how runId is passed to the logger\",\"files\":[\"src/cli.ts\"]}],\"reuse\":[\"search_tours_memory_path\",\"find_memory_run_references\",\"read_explore_ts\",\"read_explore_ts_part2\",\"read_explore_ts_part3\",\"read_citation_validator\",\"read_citation_validator_part2\",\"read_citation_validator_last\"]}\n\nExplore the repository using the tools. Assess whether the evidence answers the objective; if essential evidence is missing, use further tools before returning. Record unresolved gaps in uncertainties. Return only JSON matching this exact shape: {\"objective\":\"...\",\"entryPoints\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"components\":[{\"name\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"relations\":[{\"from\":\"...\",\"to\":\"...\",\"evidence\":[{\"file\":\"relative/path\",\"startLine\":1,\"endLine\":1}]}],\"uncertainties\":[\"...\"]}. Use empty arrays when needed. Each evidence must be an array of objects with real file paths and integer line numbers, not a string. Do not write a tour. Script memory is enabled. memory_list(query) returns the catalogue WITHOUT function source code: id (TypeScript identifier), objective (canonical question), description (scope), typed params, output contract, limits and uncertainty cases. Available entries: [{\"id\":\"search_tours_memory_path\",\"objective\":\"Find all references to the path .tours